OL,3,AGunmen kill Costa Rican journalist who
OL,4,Areported on drugs trade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Costa Rican journalist who denounced
OL,7,Falleged links between politicians and
OL,8,Fdrug traffickers in the Central
OL,9,FAmerican country has been shot dead.
OL,11,FPolice said gunmen on a motorbike
OL,12,Fambushed Camilo Rodriguez, 50, as he
OL,13,Fwas travelling in his car north of the
OL,14,Fcapital, San Jose, on Monday afternoon.
OL,16,FThe independent reporter earlier said
OL,17,Fhe had been receiving death threats
OL,18,Ffrom drug trafficking gangs.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
