OL,3,AGunmen kill Costa Rican journalist who
OL,4,Areported on drugs trade
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal media reported that it was the
OL,7,Ffirst murder of a journalist in more
OL,8,Fthan two decades in Costa Rica. It
OL,9,Fcomes at a time when transnational
OL,10,Fcrime gangs are increasing their
OL,11,Fpresence in the country, driving up its
OL,12,Fformerly low homicide rate.
